    USER["User message / documents"]:::hub

    L1B["<b>(1) Tool-schema boundary</b><br/>17 MCP tools only — 9 read · 8 write<br/>No arbitrary code · no unapproved API"]:::L1

    L2B["<b>(2) Human confirmation gate</b><br/>Explicit affirmative consent per write<br/>confirmation turn ID → AGENT_ACTION_LOG"]:::L2

    L3B["<b>(3) Session key scope</b><br/>EIP-7702: named tools · value cap · 24h TTL<br/>Revocable · out-of-scope rejected on-chain"]:::L3

    L4B["<b>(4) Injection scan + lifecycle middleware</b><br/>Pattern scanner before prompt (OWASP LLM01)<br/>HTTP 403 on write POST without confirmation"]:::L4

    OUT["On-chain write · audit trail"]:::hub

    USER --> L4B --> L1B --> L2B --> L3B --> OUT

    NOTE["No single layer bypasses all others —<br/>model output cannot override middleware"]:::hub
    L4B -.-> NOTE
